      "<Picture 1> is fully referenced. -- integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, warp jump acceleration chamber. Through forward canopy, stars stretch into brilliant beams of sapphire and violet light. The pilot <Picture 1> holds controls steady under mild G-force. -- overall_soundscape: Accelerating warp drive whine, cockpit vibration, quiet steady breathing. -- non_diegetic_music: Accelerating orchestral crescendo.",
